$$$$ TRC      NOTICE  SP204843  22/12/19    21:15:07     11531          
                                             DATE     22/12/19

    Procedure TRC                            Voir aussi :
    _____________

    TRC MOD1 MAT1 TINI TFIN LRE1 MOT1 (FLOT1) ;

FRAN==========================================================
    Objet :
    _______

  Cette procedure  permet de calculer  un diagramme  TRC a  partir  d'un
  modele metallurgique.

+---------+-----------------------------------------+----------+
| Entrees | Description                             | Type     |
+---------+-----------------------------------------+----------+
| MOD1    |Modele de formulation METALLURGIQUE      | MMODEL   |
| MAT1    |Caracteristiques du Modele METALLURGIQUE | MCHAML   |
| TINI    |Temperature initiale                     | FLOTTANT |
| TFIN    |Temperature finale                       | FLOTTANT |
| LRE1    |Liste des vitesses de refroidissement    | LIRTREEL |
| MOT1    |Phase consommee au refroidissement       | MOT      |
| FLOT1   |Seuil de detection d'une transformation  | FLOTTANT |
|         |de phase (0.005 par defaut)              |          |
+---------+-----------------------------------------+----------+

ANGL==========================================================
    Description :
    _____________

  This   procedure   compute   a   CCT    diagram   (Continuous  Cooling
  Transformation) from a metallurgic model.

+---------+-----------------------------------------+----------+
| Inputs  | Description                             | Type     |
+---------+-----------------------------------------+----------+
| MOD1    |METALLURGIQUE model formulation          | MMODEL   |
| MAT1    |Caracteristics of the METALLURGIQUE model| MCHAML   |
| TINI    |Initial Temperature                      | FLOTTANT |
| TFIN    |Final   Temperature                      | FLOTTANT |
| LRE1    |List of cooling rate temperatures        | LIRTREEL |
| MOT1    |Phase name consumed during cooling       | MOT      |
| FLOT1   |Detection threshold of a phase trans-    | FLOTTANT |
|         |formation (0.005 by default)             |          |
+---------+-----------------------------------------+----------+
$$$$
 
 
